    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 29">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 29</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa fæmnan beswice unbeweddode ⁊ hire midslæpe, forgielde hie ⁊ hæbbe hi siððan him to wife. Gif ðære fæmnan fæder hie ðonne sellan nelle, agife he ðæt feoh æfter þam weotuman.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone deceives a virgin not yet betrothed and sleeps with her, let him compensate her and have her as a wife. If, however, her father will not give her [to him], let him give [her money] equivalent to the bride-price.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa fæmnan beswyce unbeweddode ⁊ hire midslæpe, forgylde heo ⁊ hæbbe hy syððan him to wife. Gif þære fæmnan fæder heo þonne syllan nelle, agife he þæt feoh æfter þam weotuman.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
